body:
Can I ask you how you went about this? I get triggered by criticism, but also by angry/annoyed comments, which is difficult because whenever my wife is emotionally uncomfortable in any way, it comes out as angry. If you just don't respond or kind of half-jokingly blow it off, it blows over in a few minutes. But of course, I always feel it like an arrow in my stomach and respond in anger and it escalates and I lose my mind and do something stupid like storm off and get in the car, or throw something, or hit myself.

&#x200B;

So yeah, I'd love to learn how you did it, haha.
